Bundle-Name: DCAT.Atlas Telemetry
Bundle-Description: What this portal holds, as OpenTelemetry metrics. It binds the DCAT.Atlas \
 runtime service and turns each snapshot into a handful of gauges, reaching into nothing: \
 everything here comes from a DTO the portal decided to hand out. \
 \
 Optional in both directions — nothing in the portal requires this bundle, and this bundle \
 requires no part of the portal beyond the runtime service's API.

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.dto;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.service.component.annotations;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.service.metatype.annotations;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.dcat.atlas.api;version=snapshot,\
	org.eclipse.osgi-technology.opentelemetry.repack;version=latest

-testpath: \
	${junit},\
	junit-platform-launcher;version=latest
